.IX Title "YaraFFI::Record::YR_RULE 3pm"
.TH YaraFFI::Record::YR_RULE 3pm 2025-10-30 "perl v5.38.2" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
YaraFFI::Record::YR_RULE \- FFI Record for YARA rule structure
.SH VERSION
.IX Header "VERSION"
Version 0.07
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 1
\&    use YaraFFI::Record::YR_RULE;
\&
\&    # In YARA callback, cast rule pointer to record
\&    my $rule = $ffi\->cast(\*(Aqopaque\*(Aq, \*(Aqrecord(YaraFFI::Record::YR_RULE)*\*(Aq, $rule_ptr);
\&
\&    # Access rule fields safely
\&    my $name_ptr = $rule\->identifier;
\&    my $metas_ptr = $rule\->metas;
\&    my $strings_ptr = $rule\->strings;
.Ve
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
Represents the YR_RULE structure from YARA's libyara. This is a partial
definition focusing on commonly accessed fields. The actual YARA structure
is larger and more complex.
.SH "STRUCTURE FIELDS"
.IX Header "STRUCTURE FIELDS"
.IP "g_flags (sint32)" 4
.IX Item "g_flags (sint32)"
Global flags for the rule
.IP "t_flags (sint32)" 4
.IX Item "t_flags (sint32)"
Thread-specific flags
.IP "identifier (opaque)" 4
.IX Item "identifier (opaque)"
Pointer to the rule name string
.IP "tags (opaque)" 4
.IX Item "tags (opaque)"
Pointer to tags array
.IP "metas (opaque)" 4
.IX Item "metas (opaque)"
Pointer to metadata array (YR_META structures)
.IP "strings (opaque)" 4
.IX Item "strings (opaque)"
Pointer to strings array (YR_STRING structures)
.IP "ns (opaque)" 4
.IX Item "ns (opaque)"
Pointer to namespace structure
